<navigation-bar warmSwiss="{{true}}" title="看院安排" back="{{true}}" guardBack="{{true}}" fallbackUrl="/pages/appointment/index"></navigation-bar><view class="story-shell" style="{{fontStyle}}"><text class="story-badge">演示数据 · 不联系真实机构</text><text class="story-title">体验看院预约</text>
<block wx:if="{{story}}"><view class="story-card"><text class="story-heading">{{story.name}}</text><text>{{timeLabel}}：{{time}}</text><text class="story-muted">先确认接收条件、照护安排及费用，再商定看院时间。本页只记录演示安排，不发送预约请求。</text></view>
<view class="story-section"><text class="story-heading">本次看院</text><text wx:if="{{state === 'completed'}}">案例已包含一次完成的看院，可记录现场感受。</text><text wx:elif="{{state}}">演示预约已记录，不会发送给机构。</text><text wx:else>准备好后可保存一份演示安排。</text><view class="story-actions"><button wx:if="{{!state}}" class="story-primary" bindtap="confirm">保存演示预约</button><button wx:if="{{state === 'completed'}}" class="story-primary" bindtap="evaluate">{{evaluated ? '查看看院评价' : '填写看院评价'}}</button><button bindtap="records">查看我的预约</button></view><text wx:if="{{saved}}" class="story-status">演示安排已保存，未联系机构。</text></view></block><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="story-error" role="alert">{{error}}</text></view>
